<DocsExample TExample="CarouselBasicExample" Title="Multi-browse carousel" Description="The default MultiBrowse layout shows large items beside smaller peeking ones. Every item needs an AriaLabel." />
<DocsExample TExample="CarouselUncontainedExample" Title="Item width and snapping" Description="PreferredItemWidth and ItemHeight size the items, Uncontained keeps them a constant width, and EnableSnapping settles on item edges." />
<DocsExample TExample="CarouselAutoPlayExample" Title="Autoplay and index changes" Description="AutoPlayInterval rotates items every N seconds (it must be greater than zero), and OnIndexChanged reports the settled index." />
<DocsExample TExample="CarouselClickExample" Title="Clickable items" Description="OnClickCallback on NTCarouselItem handles activation of an item." />
